---
import DocumentLayout from "../layouts/DocumentLayout.astro";
---

<DocumentLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="Privacy information for the personal portfolio of Yousuf Khan."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>

  <p>
    This is a static personal portfolio hosted on GitHub Pages. I do not run advertising, analytics, account registration, a contact form, or a customer database on this site. The site does not set cookies. It stores one preference named <code>theme</code> in your browser's local storage so your light or dark theme choice remains in place on your next visit. That preference stays in your browser and is not sent to me by the site's code.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting and request data</h2>

  <p>
    GitHub delivers the files and may process technical request data such as an IP address, browser information, requested URL, and request time as part of operating GitHub Pages. GitHub controls that processing under its own privacy statement. The fonts and profile image used here are served with the site files. The portfolio does not load a third-party analytics script or tracking pixel.
  </p>

  <h2>External links and email</h2>

  <p>
    Links to GitHub, LinkedIn, Medium, the resume host, PageSpeed Insights, and email leave this site. Those services apply their own privacy terms and may record your visit. If you email me, your email provider and mine process the message, and I keep it only as long as needed to handle the conversation or meet a legal obligation. Do not send sensitive personal data through an introductory email.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions and changes</h2>

  <p>
    For a privacy question or a request concerning an email you sent me, contact <a href="mailto:ratulcse27@gmail.com">ratulcse27@gmail.com</a>. I may update this notice when the site's hosting, storage, or third-party links change. The sitemap records this page as updated on 22 August 2026.
  </p>
</DocumentLayout>
